> approach, at the cost of all the syntax complexities/oddities.


Read more, guess less.

- A low-level interface upon which high-level interface can be built
http://rpy.sourceforge.net/rpy2/doc/html/overview.html#design-notes
http://rpy.sourceforge.net/rpy2/doc/html/robjects.html#overview

- Better similarity between R and rpy code:
http://rpy.sourceforge.net/rpy2/doc/html/introduction.html#principal-component-analysis

- No more CONVERSION/NO_CONVERSION poking.
http://rpy.sourceforge.net/rpy2/doc/html/robjects.html#overview


